WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.000
Every campaign brings shoppers to your store.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.165
Almost all of them leave without buying,

3
00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:07.485
and without telling you who they were.

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:09.567
Take one of them.

5
00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.553
She lands from an Instagram ad.

6
00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.895
No account, no email, no history.

7
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:16.282
From the very first click,

8
00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.534
Convertive builds a live profile.

9
00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.556
Every view, every hesitation.

10
00:00:20.556 --> 00:00:23.174
Intent and exit risk, in real time.

11
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:26.309
At thirty-two seconds, she's about to leave.

12
00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:28.885
Convertive ranks every action it could take,

13
00:00:28.885 --> 00:00:31.152
and picks the one most likely to work,

14
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:33.050
in forty-one milliseconds.

15
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.735
She sees one offer: ten percent off, today only.

16
00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:38.927
She enters her email to claim it,

17
00:00:38.927 --> 00:00:43.337
and her anonymous visit becomes a known profile in your email tools.

18
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.032
Forty-seven seconds after she arrived,

19
00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:47.542
the order is placed.

20
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.504
Without Convertive,

21
00:00:50.504 --> 00:00:52.956
the same visit ends at forty-one seconds.

22
00:00:52.956 --> 00:00:53.686
No sale.

23
00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:54.469
No email.

24
00:00:54.469 --> 00:00:55.658
No way back.

25
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.125
Most tools react hours later.

26
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:01.087
Convertive acts while the shopper is still there.

27
00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:03.951
Live profiles, real-time decisioning,

28
00:01:03.951 --> 00:01:05.498
and in-session journeys,

29
00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.914
on top of the stack you already run.

30
00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.504
Convertive.

31
00:01:09.504 --> 00:01:12.266
Convert anonymous visitors before they leave.
